# Task Module API Requests

@host = http://localhost:3000/api
@taskId = REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID

### 1. List All Tasks
GET {{host}}/task
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a New Task
POST {{host}}/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build REST API Starter",
  "description": "Implement feature-based modular architecture and database metadata inspection"
}

### 3. Get Task by ID
GET {{host}}/task/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update Task Status
PATCH {{host}}/task/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "title": "Build REST API Starter (In Progress)"
}

### 5. Delete Task
DELETE {{host}}/task/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json
